  "description": "A typesafe F# DSL for building and reading Excel workbooks (.xlsx/.xlsm), interpreted into calls against the DocumentFormat.OpenXml SDK. Unlike write-only Excel generators, it round-trips: read an existing file back into the same immutable model, and regenerate equivalent F# source from it via built-in code generation. Covers cells, styles, formulas (including shared-formula reconstruction on read), conditional formatting, data validation, tables, charts, images, pivot tables (with real aggregation), sparklines, and VBA macro embedding.",
